      "observed": "The STM32H753 VCAP pins 48 and 73 are assigned to UART3_TX_FCC and UART3_RX_FCC. The STM32F405 VCAP_1 pin 62 and VCAP_2 pin 47 are assigned to I2C3_SDA_NAVC and UART3_TX_NAVC. No VCAP capacitors are shown.",
